00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:02,800
And that to him is a very strong argument against any idea I have.

32
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,800
Normally I don't do that.

33
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:08,160
It's like, no, there's no like, well, it tastes better, it's cheaper, there's nothing.

34
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,000
I just don't do that thing.

35
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,160
Well, why don't we just start?

