00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:56,480
because now suddenly we're dealing with people that we are, that we are very closely related

141
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,480
to.

142
00:07:57,480 --> 00:08:00,480
They are an extension of oneself in a way.

143
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,840
All right.

144
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:08,360
So now, so if you've got perfectly selfish people who are not relatives at all, there

145
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:10,800
are still funny ways that you can get cooperation there.

146
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,440
We already talked about them when we did game theory.

