00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:15,240
So you've got two people, they're not related at all.

148
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:18,160
They don't intrinsically care about each other at all.

149
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,520
How can they get, make cooperation work?

