00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:24,200
Well, we talked about, so game, game, remember game theory.

151
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:27,160
What's the obvious way they can make cooperation work?

152
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,720
Starts with an R. Repeated play.

153
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,080
It's repeated play.

154
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,960
So that's why I mentioned going and giving all your food away to a stranger will never

155
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,320
reciprocate.

156
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:41,960
If you go and give some food to another person who you know, who lives around you, who might

