00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,560
Right?

170
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,480
So you have someone that everyone wants to be around.

171
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:28,080
That is a very good strategy to apply, right?

172
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:31,120
Because you are hoping that they will remember, oh, this is a good person here that we can

