00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:44,160
Okay.

177
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,160
All right.

178
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:49,520
So mere cooperation is not good evidence against human selfishness.

179
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:52,520
The mere fact that people trade with each other doesn't show that we are not totally

